### ========================================================
### InfraSight – Indore Infrastructure Monitor REST API
### Click "Send Request" above any query to test inside VS Code
### ========================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Global Infrastructure Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/stats

### 3. List All Issues
GET {{baseUrl}}/issues

### 4. Filter Issues by Category & Priority
GET {{baseUrl}}/issues?type=pothole&min_score=80

### 5. Fetch Single Issue Detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/issues/IS-0092

### 6. Heatmap Coordinate Clusters
GET {{baseUrl}}/heatmap

### 7. Filter Heatmap by Hazard Type
GET {{baseUrl}}/heatmap?type=pothole

### 8. Run AI Computer Vision Photo Scan
POST {{baseUrl}}/reports/scan
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 9. Create New Citizen Hazard Report
POST {{baseUrl}}/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Severe road cavity outside Scheme 54",
  "category": "Road & Potholes",
  "address": "AB Road near Vijay Nagar Square",
  "area": "Vijay Nagar",
  "ward": "Ward 34",
  "description": "Deep asphalt crater causing traffic slowdown",
  "latitude": 22.7533,
  "longitude": 75.8937,
  "citizen_name": "Indore Resident",
  "citizen_phone": "+91 98260 99887"
}

### 10. Update Issue Status (Officer Triage)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/issues/IS-0092/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "In Progress",
  "changed_by": "Chief Zone Engineer"
}

### 11. Verify Repair & Close Ticket
POST {{baseUrl}}/issues/IS-0092/verify-repair
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "officer": "Quality Control Auditor",
  "notes": "Verified surface compaction and smooth bitumen finish."
}
